      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Not the snake python. This was named after an 80s Comedy Show\nMonty Python's ******.\n\n-> Very readable code. \n\n1) indentation -> python's core syntax\n2) types are decided during runtime (dynamic typing) -> \n    -> type of data/information\n    -> integer, floating point (fractional value)\n    -> string (text)\n    -> boolean (yes/no // true/false)\n\n\n    -> complex data -> object -> OOP (Object-Oriented Programming)\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Not the snake python. This was named after an 80s Comedy Show\nMonty Python's ******.\n\n-> Very readable code. \n\n1) indentation -> python's core syntax\n2) types are decided during runtime (dynamic typing) -> \n    -> type of data/information\n    -> integer, floating point (fractional value)\n    -> string (text)\n    -> boolean (yes/no // true/false)\n\n\n    -> complex data -> object -> OOP (Object-Oriented Programming)\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
